{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41605","headline":"闻杜牧赴阙 · 伍乔","name":"闻杜牧赴阙","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"旧隐匡庐一草堂，今闻携策谒吾皇。\n峡云难卷从龙势，古劒终腾出土光。\n开翅定期归碧落，濯缨宁肯问沧浪。\n他时得意交知仰，莫忘裁诗寄钓乡。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"伍乔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41605.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41605","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}